{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-10",
  "title": "破碎温室",
  "storyCode": "13-12",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b821d9853a12db0dd2e573c4b51d1fca9cfbb74ba6d5a09a8d55aa4467f87cc4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g6_townbuildingsite"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下午好，玛格达尔。你捧着花的样子还是那么漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你，汉克。你见到威尔了吗？我在找他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他一早订了花，可是都下午了还没有来取。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "威尔订的花？哦，是为了芙蕾达的生日吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中午他就翘班溜走了，兴许是为芙蕾达准备惊喜去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别担心，等他被芙蕾达教训的时候，他会记起来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们看上去很憔悴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我最近晚上都听到工地这边有声响，你们一直没有休息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近那些魔族佬像是要给谁展示功绩，死了命地催大伙日夜赶工，可也没看到有啥大人物来呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你运气真好，被人分配了个好差事，不用遭这些罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没想到大伙咬咬牙，居然只用了不到一个月就建成了这些奇迹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我打赌，这东西要是放以前，准会被那些伦蒂尼姆的贵族老爷们全搬进博物馆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汉克，你明明之前很讨厌这份工作......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......玛格达尔，世道变了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（你也得学着讨好那个萨卡兹军官，这对你没有坏处，孩子。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谢谢你的建议，汉克，我会考虑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦躁的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦躁的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近这些炮声怎么越来越近了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦躁的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说不止一伙人想要占领我们布伦特伍德镇，可万一真打起来又是乌烟瘴气，唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦躁的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在这样大家都和和气气不好吗？只求别影响了我们的工期！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚少年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛格达尔姐姐，可算找到你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚少年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个经常去你家的魔族佬在带人砸你的温室！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g7_towngreenhouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "够了吗？我说过这里不可能藏着那些维多利亚人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在可不是你说了算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这间毫无用处的屋子是你当初力保才留下的，谁知道你藏了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，我们都该为殿下死战到底，你的软弱让我们一次又一次丧失好机会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意你的口气，雇佣兵，我现在还是王庭军的成员，这里的指挥官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，要是我在这里找到藏着的游击队，我马上宰了你领功，也申请加入王庭军。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收好那些让我反胃的厌战情绪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些人的行动已经严重干扰了军事委员会在这里的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是你在前线的失利让那些人越来越猖狂，头儿也不至于决定仓促完成任务提前交差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，闭上你的嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的温室......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嘘——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不要动，安静看着。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放松，你的手指在流血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要试图挣脱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我在救你的命，“园丁”。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放她过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她最好真的想对我动手，那样我砍了她就完事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你对这座镇子太客气了，“指挥官”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "靠瞪眼睛可杀不死我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，扫兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "花草对这场战争毫无意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兵工厂，炸药房，焚烧炉，它们才是你们真正需要的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放开我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很冷静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们找到想要的东西了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你运气很好，没有让我们搜出来什么东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那请你们离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为你会比工地那些蠢货更有胆子一点呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，维多利亚人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别动，你的手指需要包扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我拦不下他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在前线......发生了些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马上会有另一个人来接替我的职位，他对小镇，呃，另有安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布伦特伍德入口西边两百米左右的水泥工事有一处缺口，是那些附近游荡的游击队刚炸出来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们不会放弃这个机会，所以我们要在明天早上五点修复那个缺口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些玫瑰还有救，想办法重新栽好这些可怜的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你对那个缺口好奇，今晚带上这些玫瑰穿过我们的营地，这是最安全的路径。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是有人拦你，就说你在替我送订单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，如果能顺道放一束花在我的营帐，我会很开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些东西不该被摧毁，“园丁”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“园丁”不是我的名字，萨卡兹，我的名字是玛格达尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，那就重新认识一下，我的名字是“锹子”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“锹子”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭军尉官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记住，玛格达尔，时间不等人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的营帐应该是这个方向......得赶紧把花送过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么在这？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛格达尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......宵禁时间你拿着花要去哪？\n这边是军营方向，快离开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......没事，只是想出来走走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，听汉克说今天是你的生日，生日快乐！威尔在我这为你订了花，但一直没有来取。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你见到威尔，记得提醒他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蕾达？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么不说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我来，这边不安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_towerinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......这些花？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是威尔放这悼念我父亲的。这间仓库我一直锁着，只有威尔想偷偷喝酒的时候我才会把钥匙借他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这门礼炮，这是韦斯特先生为农事节特意准备的？真是壮观......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我对不起威尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "威尔出什么事了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚在萨卡兹的军营里，威尔被那些魔族佬留下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他今天提前找到我想准备惊喜。但知道我要进军营汇报施工进度后，他不放心，就自告奋勇护送我去军营......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可那些萨卡兹没有道理留下威尔......他们从来没这么干过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道......我很害怕，我不敢拒绝他们扣下威尔的要求......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明我什么都听他们的了。我完成了他们交代的所有要求，为什么还要留下威尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么......玛格达尔，我真的做错了吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蕾达，也许，也许他们只是留下威尔想问些什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "往好的地方想想，他们还需要威尔继续为他们卖力呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......那些鬼东西还差一点才建完，他们一定也需要威尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要守在军营门口，等着威尔出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛格达尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_494_vendla_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蕾达......你看到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1069_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它刚才......在看着我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
